{"id":"n38944-2-5","stage":5,"title":"낙관 · 乐观","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38944-2-5-1","ko":"민준이는 참 긍정적이고 밝아.","zh":"敏俊真的非常积极开朗。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"긍정적이고","meaning":"正面的，积极的","explanation":"긍정적：正面的，积极的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"긍정적","audio":"/audio/2a3aa050974245f69f74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40132","senseId":"2","lemma":"긍정적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"긍정적이고","audio":"/audio/161a6fc1fa304607b47a.mp3"}},{"text":"밝아.","meaning":"开朗，明朗","explanation":"밝다：开朗，明朗；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"밝다","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62105","senseId":"4","lemma":"밝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밝아","audio":"/audio/8c849b0864b5a604da37.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"2a3aa050974245f6","term":"긍정적","zh":"正面的，积极的","audio":"/audio/2a3aa050974245f69f74.mp3","entryId":"40132","definition":"可取或值得看好。","pronunciation":["긍ː정적"]},{"id":"e97bef4d1c5d4c2f","term":"밝다","zh":"开朗，明朗","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3","entryId":"62105","definition":"表情，性格或气氛等愉快而活泼。","pronunciation":["박따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b1fdb84dd2675ac06c6d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n38944-2-5-2","ko":"응. 인생을 낙관을 하며 살아서 그런 것 같아.","zh":"嗯，大概是因为他总是以乐观的态度面对生活吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"인생을","meaning":"人生","explanation":"인생：人生；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인생","audio":"/audio/f5266ca313518a9f06d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62449","senseId":"1","lemma":"인생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인생을","audio":"/audio/2805b53c67c1786d1d4f.mp3"}},{"text":"낙관을","meaning":"乐观","explanation":"낙관：乐观；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"낙관","audio":"/audio/cff01191a4d3f9cbc133.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38944","senseId":"2","lemma":"낙관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낙관을","audio":"/audio/e96b9b5914b388771001.mp3"}},{"text":"하며","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为。；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하며","audio":"/audio/3b1c9412801289ec45ad.mp3"}},{"text":"살아서","meaning":"生活，过活，过日子","explanation":"살다：生活，过活，过日子；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"2","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살아서","audio":"/audio/f1a340522a2a66762aa6.mp3"}},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"f5266ca313518a9f","term":"인생","zh":"人生","audio":"/audio/f5266ca313518a9f06d1.mp3","entryId":"62449","definition":"人在世上生活的事。","pronunciation":["인생"]},{"id":"cff01191a4d3f9cb","term":"낙관","zh":"乐观","audio":"/audio/cff01191a4d3f9cbc133.mp3","entryId":"38944","definition":"积极并充满希望地看待人生或世界。","pronunciation":["낙꽌"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"以某种方式构成行为。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"以某种方式构成行为。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"生活，过活，过日子","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"人过生活。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e3293246